id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43078::$$$message_0357_0000_0000$$$::"Rin, there they are! It's Caster!"::
43079::$$$message_0357_0000_0001$$$::"Good eye, Archer! There's Clairvoyance for ya!"::
43080::$$$message_0357_0000_0002$$$::"Hm, seems there's some kind of commotion."::
43081::$$$message_0357_0000_0003$$$::"Tohsaka."::
43082::$$$message_0357_0000_0004$$$::"Nothing personal, Caster, but you're coming with me."::
43083::$$$message_0357_0000_0005$$$::"May I at least ask why?"::
43084::$$$message_0357_0000_0006$$$::"Well, I don't know, either."::
43085::$$$message_0357_0001_0000$$$::"But I need you to come with me because there's no telling what Saber might do otherwise."::
43086::$$$message_0357_0001_0001$$$::"What have you done, Caster?[lr]::
43087::$$$message_0357_0001_0002$$$::Saber is unusually furious."::
43088::$$$message_0357_0001_0003$$$::"Seriously... She said she'd Excaliblast the house if we didn't do what she said, and that we wouldn't even see it coming from inside the Bounded Field."::
43089::$$$message_0357_0001_0004$$$::"Speaking of which, Sakura and Rider went dashing out the door, too... She must have threatened them too, somehow."::
43090::$$$message_0357_0001_0005$$$::"I'm impressed by the King of Knights. She'll stop at nothing to achieve her goals...contrary to appearances."::
43091::$$$message_0357_0001_0006$$$::"Answer me, Caster. What did you do to Saber?"::
43092::$$$message_0357_0001_0007$$$::"Why don't you just ask her yourself?"::
43093::$$$message_0357_0001_0008$$$::"I did! But then she glared at me something fierce. Shirou looked like he had a clue, but he was next to her just trembling."::
43094::$$$message_0357_0001_0009$$$::"He looked somewhat gaunt."::
43095::$$$message_0357_0001_0010$$$::"Heh. Oh, little Saber. She would actually go this far for a grudge?"::
43096::$$$message_0357_0001_0011$$$::"...So it's your doing after all."::
43097::$$$message_0357_0001_0012$$$::"Bah! That doesn't matter![lr]::
43098::$$$message_0357_0001_0013$$$::Deal with this, Assassin!"::
43099::$$$message_0357_0001_0014$$$::"...Goodness."::
¤